The '''Cement Mixer''' is one of the eleven workbench types in ''[[Human Host]]''.

Produces concrete for high-tier reinforced structures.

Internal enum value: <code>WorkbenchType.CementMixer</code> (assembly <code>UI</code>). Prefab: <code>WB_Concrete_Mixer</code>.

